          "image_source": "images/page_11_image_9.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.203,
            0.76,
            0.847,
            0.799
          ],
          "content": "(i) If we include one value to the data (in the given list) without affecting the median, what could that value be?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.197,
            0.802,
            0.846,
            0.841
          ],
          "content": "(ii) If we include two values to the data without affecting the median what could the two values be?"
        },
        {
